    "market_commentary": "The SSY Atlantic Capesize Index fell to a new low not seen since 13 December 2020, down 378 points from last week to 6,361. SSY’s assessed roundvoyage rate edged lower by $750/day to $5,000/day and the fronthaul rate decreased $850/day to $19,000/day.",
